| 14| **Winter Lights at Camelback** (holiday light display) | **≈ 14 mi** | Over 1 million LED lights, ice‑skating rink, and hot‑cocoa stands. | **Late November – Early January**. |
| 15| **Pocono Mountain Wine & Beer Trail** (local breweries & vineyards) | **≈ 20‑30 mi** | Sample craft beers at **Barley Creek Brewing Co.** and wines at **Bucks County Winery**. | **May – October** (tasting rooms open). |
